## item's name (the hotbar's "Can't Move Items can't be: moved, dropped, removed, crafted with",
## "This item is not lost on death", and the same in the inventory's hover text) are blank. The
## lock corner and "Can't move item" are hidden too (textures/ui, ui/ui_common.json).
